# The bundle's staged shared library.
#
# `openstrata_configure_plugin` puts the built library here, in the *source*
# tree, because plugInfo.json's LibraryPath is resolved relative to
# plugInfo.json and a plugin bundle is a directory layout rather than a build
# artifact. The root .gitignore already covers the Windows spelling; this covers
# the other two, so that a Linux or macOS build does not offer to commit one.
/lib/
